  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambay Basin Oil and Gas Development, through Advanced Resources International, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for Deep Industries Limited, a private oil and gas exploration company in India, to assess the development of oil and gas resources at a gas block in the Cambay Basin in Gujarat, India. The objective of this feasibility study is to help DIL make a commercial case and develop a strategy for conventional and unconventional oil and gas production at the Cambay Basin site.</narrative>
  </description>
